# Messages

*dlgCreateSurface.errEqualLevels:       Levels must be different

*dlgCreateSurface*errNoRememberedSurface:\
No highlighted surface remembered.\n\
Highlight a surface with the Examine tool,\n\
then press the '<' button again.

*dlgCreateSurface.errBadCreatorId:\
The surface last highlighted was not created using\n\
this dialog box.\n\
Highlight a surface created using this dialog box\n\
with the Examine tool, and press the '<<' button\n\
again.

*dlgCreateSurface.errOldSurfacesNotFound:\
No old surfaces have been found.\n\
Highlight a surface created using this dialog box\n\
with the Examine tool and press the '<<' button again,\n\
or disable 'Remove old surfaces'.


